  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When setting a camera to world space, Ive noticed that we can now grab it and move it around. \nHowever, doing so resets it to follow the player. This might be an intentional feature, but it should probably retain its setting and stay locked to the world so that we don't have to repeatedly reset the anchor.\nTo recreate, grab the camera after setting its anchor to world space, and it will then follow you around.",
